{"uid":"328cf396d2e40b88","name":"test_open_events_reader_does_not_hold_an_exhausted_engine_up","fullName":"tests.test_e2e#test_open_events_reader_does_not_hold_an_exhausted_engine_up","historyId":"fe683745793be68f8dee131bdf06af9f","time":{"start":1791980482374,"stop":1791980484705,"duration":2331},"description":"A run that holds `exhausted` (v0.36 requirement G) is resumable, so the\n    engine process exits on its own at once -- `--no-detach` and `watch` follow\n    `/events` and only stop reading on a terminal state they recognise, which a\n    resumable hold is not. The API therefore has to end an `/events` stream\n    itself once this process's job is over; before it did, the open reader\n    held uvicorn's graceful shutdown (and so the engine) up forever while the\n    reader waited for the engine to go away.","descriptionHtml":"<p>A run that holds <code>exhausted</code> (v0.36 requirement G) is resumable, so the<br />\nengine process exits on its own at once -- <code>--no-detach</code> and <code>watch</code> follow<br />\n<code>/events</code> and only stop reading on a terminal state they recognise, which a<br />\nresumable hold is not. The API therefore has to end an <code>/events</code> stream<br />\nitself once this process's job is over; before it did, the open reader<br />\nheld uvicorn's graceful shutdown (and so the engine) up forever while the<br />\nreader waited for the engine to go away.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791980249757,"stop":1791980249757,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791980249758,"stop":1791980249758,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],